      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766160313086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\nNode Affinity\n\n\nIt is like a node selector but more powerful and flexible\ndb pods on ssd nodes.\nml pods on gpu nodes\npod will say schedule me only where label=gpu",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\nNode Affinity\n\n\nIt is like a node selector but more powerful and flexible\ndb pods on ssd nodes.\nml pods on gpu nodes\npod will say schedule me only where label=gpu",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
