      "seed": 810546112,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 994190272,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766160869624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Anti-Affinity\npod says to k8 that don't place me near there pods\nit is useful for high-avalablility\npod-mumbai\npod2 - hyderabad\ndont keep all the pods or replicas in single node\n\nwhy affinity when taint exist\ntaint dont choose nodes it only block.\nwhile does not protect nodes it only guide the placement.\ntaint is useful for protected node",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Anti-Affinity\npod says to k8 that don't place me near there pods\nit is useful for high-avalablility\npod-mumbai\npod2 - hyderabad\ndont keep all the pods or replicas in single node\n\nwhy affinity when taint exist\ntaint dont choose nodes it only block.\nwhile does not protect nodes it only guide the placement.\ntaint is useful for protected node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
