      "text": "Requests(guraanteed)\nLimits (max usage).        - Kubelet enforces this\n\nso without requests/limits pod will consume the complete memory\nother pods will start crashing.\nnode will become unstable\n\nkubernetes will always say tell me the minimun and maximun before.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requests(guraanteed)\nLimits (max usage).        - Kubelet enforces this\n\nso without requests/limits pod will consume the complete memory\nother pods will start crashing.\nnode will become unstable\n\nkubernetes will always say tell me the minimun and maximun before.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EubgOaXWJVXTI9WmcEKQd",
      "type": "text",
